      <rules>
        <rule id="4a0c-2589-3daf-affa-821f2" name="Relic of the Armoury" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>You may only take one vehicle of this type with the Relics of the Armoury-rule unless you also take a Reclusiarch. May only be taken in a secondary detachment if that detachment also includes a Reclusiarch.</description></rule>
        <rule id="4042-decc-7fe7-0d2d-821f2" name="Helical Targeting Array" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>If the Deredeo chooses to neither move nor Run in its turn it may, if its controlling player wishes, gain the Skyfire and Interceptor special rules for that entire game turn (ie, both the controlling player's turn and their opponent's following player turn) for all of its weapons except its heavy bolters/heavy flamers.</description></rule>
        <rule id="aad5-9e69-0ed5-180b-821f2" name="Atomantic Shielding" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>5++ to shooting; 6++ against melee. +1" to Explosion!-result.</description></rule>
      </rules>
