      <rules>
        <rule id="18ed-6245-c4f9-47f0-821f2" name="Reinforced Structure" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>The Warlord Titan has an invulnerable save of 5+ against any attacks that have breached its void shields.</description></rule>
        <rule id="88b8-ac61-734b-4b2b-821f2" name="Shield Projection" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
        <description>So long as the Sokar is in Hover mode and remains stationary this turn, its controlling player may declare that it is projecting its void shields at the start of their turn. This means that their area extends to cover all units within 12" of the Sokar's main hull and wings in their protection.</description></rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="116d-be45-7eaf-d4fb-821f2" hidden="false" targetId="528d-4089-aaeb-bc3c" type="rule">
