        <rule id="mh-rad-space-wolves-94db-03e7-a177-49d6" name="Cult of Morkai" hidden="false">
          <description>Units of the Deathsworn may not be joined by Independent Character models other than Priests of Fenris. In addition, Priests of Fenris with the Speaker of the Dead sub-type may take a unit of Deathsworn instead of the usual Command Squad.</description>
