                      <description>When using the Merciless Fighters special rule, each Battle-automata counts as three models. For an additional 15 points per model, a Castellax Battle-automata with the Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) special rule may take Banestrike bolter rounds for any boltguns they have.</description>
