        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Has Rending rule in close combat. Replace usual A with D6+1, rolled immediately prior to making an attack. Made using hands, claws &amp; teeth, not wargear, additional hand weapons, etc, but may be bolstered by other factors (charging, Living Legend, etc).</characteristic>
