        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Wearer has Fear. Furthermore, enemy units with the Beasts, Cavalry or Monstrous Creature unit types in base contact with the wearer automatically fail any Fear tests unless they have And They Shall Know No Fear or Fearless.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
